  "coverage": {
    "notes": [
      {
        "kind": "simplification",
        "text": "Covers personale amministrativo assunto dal 18/12/1999 (Allegato 2/B — tabella omnicomprensiva). Pre-1999 hires (Allegato 2/A) are out of scope.",
        "capability": "base_salary",
        "monetary_impact": "yes",
        "limitation": {
          "variant": "pre_1999_hire_table",
          "applies_when": {
            "trigger": "run"
          },
          "remediation": "Model Allegato 2/A for the staff hired before 18/12/1999, gated on the hire date, or open a limitation."
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "info",
        "text": "First tranche decorrenza 01/01/2026 is retroactive; CCNL signed 13/05/2026. Arretrati January–July 2026 paid in July 2026 (Allegato 7). Period start is 2026-01-01 in the engine."
      },
      {
        "kind": "info",
        "text": "Additional months = 14 (tredicesima + quattordicesima). Monthly amounts are 1/14 of annual retribuzione. Source: Allegato 2/B header, FirstCISL PDF rinnovo 13/05/2026."
      },
      {
        "kind": "info",
        "text": "Seniority: cl 1 = anni 1-4 (48 months, quadriennale); cl 2 onward = 3 years each (36 months, triennale). Source: Art. 113 CCNL + Allegato 2/B class table."
      },
      {
        "kind": "info",
        "text": "L7 maximum seniority class is CL08 (anni 23-25); L1-L6 reach CL12 (oltre 34 anni). maximum_count_by_level overrides L7 to 7 advances."
      },
      {
        "kind": "info",
        "text": "Hourly divisor 160 (37h/week). Source: ilccnl.it, confirmed from Art. orario di lavoro CCNL ANIA."
      },
      {
        "kind": "info",
        "text": "Seniority increment amounts vary across tranches (e.g. L4: 67.51 → 70.17 → 72.30). Represented exactly via TimeSeries in amount_by_level."
      },
      {
        "kind": "simplification",
        "text": "Indennità economica funzionari (Allegato 2/D) — L7 only, six sub-grade variants (Ex 3°/2°/1° Grado, Funz. Senior, Funz. Business, Ass. ex F2) with distinct amounts. Monthly amounts not found in publicly accessible sources (Allegato 2/D not published). Not modelled.",
        "capability": "base_salary",
        "monetary_impact": "yes",
        "limitation": {
          "variant": "funzionari_economic_allowance",
          "applies_when": {
            "trigger": "outside_input",
            "levels": [
              "L7"
            ]
          },
          "remediation": "Model Allegato 2/D: the indennità economica of the six L7 funzionari sub-grades as role-keyed fixed_allowances on L7 (like IND_PROFILO_J), once the amounts are sourced."
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "info",
        "text": "Indennità profilo J) 4° livello (Allegato 2/E) — modelled as fixed_allowance IND_PROFILO_J on L4 with role 'profilo_j'. Amounts: €57.26/mese dal 01/01/2026, €59.51 dal 01/01/2027, €61.32 dal 01/01/2028. Set Employment.roles=profilo_j to include it (review of 2026-10-30)."
      },
      {
        "kind": "info",
        "text": "Indennità economica 6° livello quadro (Allegato 2/F) — modelled as fixed_allowance IND_QUADRO_6 on L6 with role 'quadro_6'. Amount: €74.09/mese dal 01/01/2026. Set Employment.roles=quadro_6 to include it (review of 2026-10-30)."
      },
      {
        "kind": "simplification",
        "text": "Seniority increment = modal per-class difference in the 1/14 monthly table (Allegato 2/B); classes above CL01 may differ from the official table by ±0.02. Source: Allegato 2/B, Rinnovo 13/05/2026.",
        "capability": "seniority",
        "monetary_impact": "yes",
        "limitation": {
          "variant": "seniority_modal_class_difference",
          "remediation": "Replace the modal per-class difference with the official Allegato 2/B amounts per class."
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "simplification",
        "text": "INPS employer_rate 26.76% flat from kitech.it (Credito e Assicurazioni 2026); reuses 2026-credito.json. Verify against the annual INPS circular.",
        "capability": "inps_employer",
        "monetary_impact": "unknown",
        "limitation": {
          "variant": "inps_credit_rate_unverified",
          "remediation": "Resolved as a duplicate of assicurazioni-ania/inps_sector_rates_unsourced, which stays open (review of 2026-10-30): both say the credito employer rate is not confirmed by a 2026 INPS source. contribution/2026/credito.json now takes 26.76 from the INPS 2012 table and keeps the Fondo di solidarietà out of the totals, in parameters.solidarity_fund.",
          "status": "resolved"
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "source",
        "text": "Salary tables: FirstCISL Gruppo Unipol, Allegato 2/B — Tabella omnicomprensiva post-1999, decorrenza 01/01/2026, 01/01/2027, 01/01/2028."
      },
      {
        "kind": "source",
        "text": "Apprenticeship: Art. 5, Allegato 18 (Accordo apprendistato professionalizzante), CCNL testo 2017/2018, confirmed applicable post-rinnovo 2026."
      },
      {
        "kind": "source",
        "text": "Class cadence: Art. 113 CCNL + column 'Anni serv.' Allegato 2/B."
      },
      {
        "kind": "simplification",
        "text": "APPRENTICE SENIORITY: the CCNL text read for this ruleset does not state whether apprentices accrue the level seniority increments or an amount of their own, and no apprentice amount is modelled. The engine pays no increment during the apprenticeship (provisional); the run is affected when the apprentice has matured increments the level pays.",
        "capability": "seniority",
        "monetary_impact": "unknown",
        "limitation": {
          "variant": "apprentice_seniority",
          "applies_when": {
            "trigger": "path",
            "contract_types": [
              "apprentice"
            ]
          },
          "remediation": "Source the CCNL clause on apprentice seniority and model it as seniority_increments.apprentice_amount (zero when apprentices accrue none), then remove this note."
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "simplification",
        "text": "INPS RATES: the employer and worker INPS rates of the sector (credito) are totals no 2026 INPS or association table confirms: the only component split found is the INPS guide of 2012 and the 2026 totals come from a software house page that does not prove its year. The contributions of every run rest on them.",
        "capability": "inps_employer",
        "monetary_impact": "unknown",
        "limitation": {
          "variant": "inps_sector_rates_unsourced",
          "applies_when": {
            "trigger": "run"
          },
          "remediation": "Source the credito rates of 2026 on an INPS or association table, mark the inps block of contribution/2026/credito.json derived, then remove this note."
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "info",
        "text": "SOLIDARITY FUND: Fondo di solidarietà del settore assicurativo (accord ANIA of 20 May 2013, D.I. 78459 of 17 January 2014): ordinary contribution 0.30% of the INPS taxable pay of permanent workers, 0.20% employer and 0.10% worker, dirigenti excluded (INPS circ. 56/2015 p. 11); collected by INPS in the overall rate."
      }
    ]
  },
